        [("ENTJ", "endorphins")] = "Endorphins low — mu-opioid reward from group achievement cascade rather than solitary mastery. Beta-endorphin release tied to ventral striatum activation during competitive victory within social hierarchy — social network scale of influence correlates with endorphin function. Anterior insula interpersonal reward from shared team success. Group reward cascade from leadership achievement, not contemplative processing depth.",
        [("ENTJ", "acetylcholine")] = "Acetylcholine moderate — muscarinic M1 activation supports strategic planning and working memory. Cholinergic attention for tactical execution, not deep reflective processing.",
