        [("ESTP", "dopamine")] = "Dopamine elevated — D2 receptor phasic burst firing in ventral striatum drives immediate reward-seeking and tactical action. VTA activation strongest during real-time competitive performance and risk-taking. Mesolimbic dominance over mesocortical — action over planning.",
